  "description": "UNLIMITED EP801 | 85 NM\n\nPowerful, lightweight, and intelligent it significantly improves assistance with more efficient energy management, offering a more natural riding experience.\n\nThe high-performance Shimano EP801 motor generates a maximum torque of 85 Nm and provides a wide cadence range. This ensures smooth and natural riding even on technical terrain or steep slopes, providing effective assistance even at low cadences.\n\nFEEL THE LIGHTNESS | 19.8 KG*\n\nWe use Hollow Core Internal Moulding (HCIM) technology, allowing us to minimise the weight of the frame and tie rod. Giving us a frame that weighs just 2,450 g.\n\n*Tubeless setup\n\n720WH | MAXIMUM AUTONOMY\n\nAll models come standard with a 540Wh battery housed in the down tube offering maximum energy density per weight and allowing more energy to be stored in a smaller space.\n\nAdditionally, the XPro external bottle is included as standard*. The XPro provides an additional 180Wh.\n\n*Except for models: iLYNX+ Trail 8.7 and iLYNX+ Enduro 9.7.\n\nXPRO+ EXTENDER & CONVENTIONAL BOTTLE\n\nThe iLynx allows the simultaneous use of a water bottle and the XPro+ battery, providing the rider with maximum range and comfort during the ride.\n\nLYNX IDENTITY\n\nThe Split Pivot suspension system, featured in all of BH's dual suspension models, maintains 100% anti-squat - ensuring pedalling efficiency - and brake squat - delivering outstanding braking.\n\nBALLISTIC CARBON LAYUP\n\nThe carbon fibre we use has allowed us to develop a lightweight frame that is highly resistant to impacts.\n\nCUSTOMIZABLE DISPLAY\n\nWith the Shimano E-Tube app, you can customize the assistance modes according to your preferences and needs.\n\nThe iLynx+SL comes with two preloaded profiles; Full Power for maximum power, and Endurance, for maximizing range to extend your ride as long as possible. These profiles can be customized to suit your needs, giving you the freedom to adapt your e-bike to your riding style and route type.\n\nAdditionally, you can switch between profiles on the go via the display.",
